 scored three touches."] "\n\n" [:p {} "Events were conducted in foil, sabre, and foil for masters (or professionals). The professional fencing matches were known by " [:a {:href "/athletes/920613"} "Coubertin"] " and the Olympic officials and, in fact, approved, as fencing masters, or teachers, were very popular athletes in France at that time. An épée event was also scheduled but did not take place."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/72000"} "Foil, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 April 1896"] "\n" [:td {} "8"] "\n" [:td {} "2"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/72029"} "Foil, Masters, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 April 1896"] "\n" [:td {} "2"] "\n" [:td {} "2"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/923213"} "Sabre, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 9 April 1896"] "\n" [:td {} "7"] "\n" [:td {} "5"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n15 (15/0)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n4 (4/0)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [:h2 {} "Medals"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] "\n" [:th {:colspan "2"} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {:class "top"} [:a {:href "/results/72000"} "Foil, Individual, Men"]] "\n" [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/athletes/21879"} "Eugène Henry Gravelotte"]] [:td {:style "vertical-align: top"} [:a {:href "/countries/FRA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :